  "summary": "C5 loads the full 60x60 region (57.86-59.04N, 21.02-22.20E) for 1991-12-27..2003-01-05 plus 2013-06-01..08-31 into /tmp/data.npy; C6 builds per-doy hazen 90th-percentile thresholds from +/-5-day pools, smooths them over 31 days, and compares target SST against thr for doy 153-244, which depends on raw thresholds for doy 138-259 and hence on baseline dates May 12-Sep 20 of each year 1992-2002. All target days and all sea cells feed the run/gap logic whose mask is written to output/mhw_mask.nc; the climatology is computed but never used."
